268
00:13:57,320 --> 00:13:59,760
that will alter the microstructure of the steel

269
00:13:59,860 --> 00:14:01,860
and harden the blade.

270
00:14:01,960 --> 00:14:04,260
The clay-covered portion will stay softer

271
00:14:04,360 --> 00:14:07,260
and absorb shock when the blade strikes.

272
00:14:07,360 --> 00:14:10,580
The heat treatment, followed by a cold salt bath,

273
00:14:10,680 --> 00:14:14,080
produces the trademark scars along the blade.

274
00:14:14,180 --> 00:14:16,640
And since the leading edge expands more than the trailing

275
00:14:16,740 --> 00:14:20,640
