524
00:27:08,120 --> 00:27:10,220
designed by World War II combat veteran

525
00:27:10,320 --> 00:27:12,720
and founder of the American Tomahawk Company,

526
00:27:12,820 --> 00:27:14,120
Peter Lagana.

527
00:27:14,220 --> 00:27:16,720
A tomahawk was strictly a piece that soldiers

528
00:27:16,820 --> 00:27:18,120
bought on their own.

529
00:27:18,220 --> 00:27:20,160
The last time it was a standard issue item,

530
00:27:20,161 --> 00:27:22,620
for Army was in the War 1812.

531
00:27:22,621 --> 00:27:25,700
But in Vietnam and in subsequent conflicts,

532
00:27:26,280 --> 00:27:29,680
American soldiers have reportedly used such tactical tomahawks

533
