537
00:27:47,580 --> 00:27:50,060
Tomahawks are still being forged as modern-day

538
00:27:50,061 --> 00:27:52,560
tools.

539
00:27:52,660 --> 00:27:56,060
A 4,000-pound hammer bangs out two tactical tomahawks

