00:28:07,120 --> 00:28:09,520
Then they're punched out under a large punch drum.

545
00:28:12,620 --> 00:28:15,620
These tomahawks are made of hardened tool steel,

546
00:28:15,720 --> 00:28:18,060
well-suited to holding their edges.

547
00:28:18,061 --> 00:28:20,960
Each has a forward blade for cutting and chopping

