00:28:31,640 --> 00:28:33,580
and I've just punctured it with this tomahawk.

553
00:28:33,680 --> 00:28:36,820
A tomahawk sharp blade is just as deadly.

554
00:28:36,920 --> 00:28:39,320
You could actually hit somebody on the side of the neck

