00:29:11,220 --> 00:29:14,080
Servicemen that buy these present-day tomahawks find

567
00:29:14,180 --> 00:29:16,860
they carry the same intimidation as they did 200

568
00:29:16,861 --> 00:29:19,800
as they did 250 years ago.

