They're people who respect blades,

572
00:29:26,501 --> 00:29:28,380
much more so than firearms.

573
00:29:28,381 --> 00:29:31,200
And so you're carrying something like this.

574
00:29:31,201 --> 00:29:32,880
It gets their attention and it gets their respect.

