667
00:34:34,661 --> 00:34:36,700
jacket that goes around the barrel.

668
00:34:36,701 --> 00:34:39,260
The barrel gets so hot during the firing,

669
00:34:39,261 --> 00:34:42,560
the water cools it and keeps it from warping.

670
00:34:42,561 --> 00:34:47,100
The ammunition would come in belts of 250 cartridges.

671
00:34:47,101 --> 00:34:50,200
It would be steered into the feed here,

672
00:34:50,201 --> 00:34:57,520
and then cock it like this, pull the belt in another time,

673
00:34:57,521 --> 00:34:59,020
cock it again.

674
00:34:59,021 --> 00:35:00,820
Now you're ready to go.

675
00:35:00,821 --> 00:35:04,220
There's both thumbs on the trigger, and you're firing.

676
00:35:04,221 --> 00:35:06,080
And if all the conditions are right,

677
00:35:06,180 --> 00:35:08,460
you can fire 500 rounds in a minute.

678
00:35:08,560 --> 00:35:11,060
During World War I, the number two weapon

679
00:35:11,160 --> 00:35:14,600
in our countdown turned the no man's land between the trenches

680
00:35:14,700 --> 00:35:16,360
