Number 10 was the M107 sniper rifle.

701
00:36:26,940 --> 00:36:28,740
Number nine, the taser.

702
00:36:28,840 --> 00:36:31,180
Number eight, the katana sword.

703
00:36:31,181 --> 00:36:33,920
Number seven, the Apache helicopter.

704
00:36:34,020 --> 00:36:36,020
Number six was VX Gas.

705
00:36:36,120 --> 00:36:38,220
Number five was pepper spray.

706
00:36:38,320 --> 00:36:40,380
Number four, the tomahawk.

707
00:36:40,480 --> 00:36:42,920
Number three, the incendiary bomb.

