00:36:43,020 --> 00:36:47,420
And number two, the Maxim machine gun.

709
00:36:47,520 --> 00:36:50,840
Now it's time to set our sights on modern Marvel's mega

710
00:36:50,940 --> 00:36:53,240
Marvel's number one weapon.

711
00:36:53,340 --> 00:36:56,940
It's a true American original that's forever changed the art

712
00:36:57,040 --> 00:37:00,240
of the crime and how we fight back.

713
00:37:00,241 --> 00:37:03,240
Our number one weapon, the handgun.

714
00:37:06,140 --> 00:37:08,780
Like it or not, the handgun has become a fixture

715
00:37:08,880 --> 00:37:12,180
of modern-day life in America.

716
00:37:12,280 --> 00:37:15,980
Handguns are the go-to weapon for criminals.

717
00:37:16,080 --> 00:37:18,300
And every year, tens of thousands of handguns

718
00:37:18,400 --> 00:37:22,600
