00:37:25,900 --> 00:37:29,340
one legendary small pistol helped level the playing field

721
00:37:29,341 --> 00:37:31,540
150 years ago.

722
00:37:31,640 --> 00:37:33,540
As they used to say in the West,

723
00:37:33,640 --> 00:37:35,240
God did not make man equal.

724
00:37:35,340 --> 00:37:36,440
Colonel Colt did.

725
00:37:36,540 --> 00:37:38,240
Back in the 19th century,

726
00:37:38,340 --> 00:37:40,580
weapon maker Samuel Colt's pocket revolver

727
00:37:40,680 --> 00:37:43,680
introduced a new concept to the world of firearms,

728
00:37:43,780 --> 00:37:46,000
a pistol small enough to hide.

729
00:37:46,100 --> 00:37:48,500
We can now take that revolver and place it into a pocket.

730
00:37:48,600 --> 00:37:49,800
It's fully concealed.

731
00:37:49,900 --> 00:37:51,100
It's very handy.

732
00:37:51,200 --> 00:37:52,300
It's lightweight.

733
00:37:52,400 --> 00:37:54,100
And it has multiple shots.

734
00:37:54,200 --> 00:37:56,540
Colt's pocket revolver was the first revolver

735
00:37:56,640 --> 00:37:58,940
reliable and accurate enough to be adopted

736
00:37:58,941 --> 00:38:03,180
by police, and part of the reason the handgun lands at number one

737
00:38:03,280 --> 00:38:04,980
