738
00:38:05,080 --> 00:38:06,480
The Colt's secret?

739
00:38:06,580 --> 00:38:09,780
Superior design and manufacturing techniques.

740
00:38:09,880 --> 00:38:11,280
It was one of the first guns in America

741
00:38:11,380 --> 00:38:13,880
to really use interchangeable parts

742
00:38:13,980 --> 00:38:18,000
and a high level of accurate machining to make the weapon.

743
00:38:18,100 --> 00:38:20,300
It was the development of the Colt pocket revolver

744
00:38:20,400 --> 00:38:24,940
