749
00:38:38,980 --> 00:38:40,680
We all know the story.

750
00:38:40,780 --> 00:38:44,120
A flamboyant actor named John Wilkes Booth snuck into President

751
00:38:44,220 --> 00:38:48,360
Abraham Lincoln's box at Ford's Theater.

752
00:38:48,460 --> 00:38:52,760
He fired at the president's head from point-blank range.

753
00:38:52,860 --> 00:38:56,240
But the reason Booth had to get so close to his target,

754
00:38:56,241 --> 00:38:57,840
The Derringer.

755
00:38:57,841 --> 00:39:01,240
This new hand pistol wasn't accurate at long range.

756
00:39:01,241 --> 00:39:05,840
It would spray bullets every which way out of the barrel.

757
00:39:05,841 --> 00:39:09,020
Today's Derringers have come a long way from the originals,

758
00:39:09,021 --> 00:39:12,660
still small in size, but much more accurate.

759
00:39:12,661 --> 00:39:15,520
Cobra Firearms, located in Salt Lake City,

760
00:39:15,521 --> 00:39:19,500
produces about 1,500 pocket Derringers every week.

761
00:39:19,501 --> 00:39:21,140
This is the beginning of a gun right here.

762
00:39:21,141 --> 00:39:22,560
This is a barrel insert.

763
00:39:22,561 --> 00:39:24,260
We're going to put that important twist.

764
00:39:24,261 --> 00:39:26,240
The twist is called rifling.

765
00:39:26,241 --> 00:39:28,240
And it's one of the most important advancements

766
00:39:28,340 --> 00:39:32,340
in gun design, and another reason handguns get the number one

767
00:39:32,440 --> 00:39:34,840
spot on our countdown.

768
00:39:34,940 --> 00:39:38,280
Small spiral grooves are cut inside the barrel.

769
00:39:38,380 --> 00:39:41,320
As the bullet travels through, it rides these grooves

770
00:39:41,420 --> 00:39:43,960
and begins to spin.

771
00:39:44,060 --> 00:39:45,660
When the bullet leaves the barrel,

772
00:39:45,760 --> 00:39:49,300
the spin continues, improving aerodynamic stability

773
00:39:49,400 --> 00:39:52,260
and accuracy.

774
00:39:52,360 --> 00:39:54,040
It keeps the centrifugal force of that bullet

775
00:39:54,041 --> 00:39:57,040
in a single direction rather than it wanting to tumble

776
00:39:57,140 --> 00:39:59,340
throughout the air.

